      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Enrichment Pipeline Monitoring\n\nThis dashboard monitors the multi-phase enrichment pipeline that processes security detections.\n\n**Pipeline Phases:**\n- **Phase 1 (Florence)**: Initial image captioning and object detection via Florence-2\n- **Phase 2**: Secondary enrichment models (CLIP scene classification, vehicle/pet/clothing analysis)\n- **Phase 3**: LLM analysis via Nemotron for risk scoring and event generation\n\n**Quality Levels:** 1 = Minimal (fast, fewer models), 2 = Standard (balanced), 3 = Full (all models enabled)\n\n**Timeouts:** Pipeline hard timeout prevents runaway processing. Monitor timeout rate for capacity planning."
      },
      "title": "Documentation",
      "type": "text"
    },
